# Goliath Daydreamer: "you may cast a spell from among cards you own in exile with dream counters" -- one spell, not each. Bot1
# casts a Lightning Bolt and a Burst Lightning from the hand on turn 3, and both are exiled with dream counters. Attacking, Bot1
# cannot choose both; it casts the Burst Lightning for nothing and the Bolt stays in exile with its counter.

